%% Underground Labyrinth. Theme: a maze of gates opened by levers (Theseus). Locks (2026-11-11, second pass with the new lever art): three floor levers (red, amber, blue), each lifts the portcullis with its colour. No loops round a lock; blind passages and dead-end cells make the maze.
%% start: E
%% goal: Mn
flowchart TD
  E["Entrance {start}"] --> A["Cell A: lever 1 {item:lever1}"]
  E --> B["Cell B"]
  B -->|req:lever1| C["Cell C: lever 2 {item:lever2}"]
  A --> D["Cell D"]
  D -->|req:lever2| F["Cell F: lever 3 {item:lever3}"]
  F -->|req:lever3| Mn["Minotaur's Hall {goal}"]
